From 748319e6fec6ffb9dc7f42ebe6b7f4928a31f4ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ss3ds <ss3ds@localhost>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:54:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ss3ds: hook 0218 alive wild Pokemon round 2 (naps, sneaking,
 pairs, squabbles, splashes, rain, huge ones, flocks)

0110 block v4 (state 'WIL3'): night naps with Zz (a loud player startles them), sneak/run notice range from P3DS_RunLast (platform ss3ds_glue.c) and the bike, a partner that travels with some, squabbles between two nearby ones, water ones jump and splash (Magikarp most), land ones hop, in rain fewer and only in tall grass or water (land ones out of grass go shelter), a rare huge one 1/1024 (1.5x, +5..10 levels, bold, achievement), flyer flocks of 2-4. All behind P3DS_WildVisCfg(5).
---
 scripts/ss3ds_hooks.d/0110_wildvis.py | 239 ++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 224 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/scripts/ss3ds_hooks.d/0110_wildvis.py b/scripts/ss3ds_hooks.d/0110_wildvis.py
index cf51d13..52e45a1 100644
